{"id":"f8095e56180f5828","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-godel-translation.md","title":"Godel Translation Theorem","display":"thm-godel-translation — Godel Translation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-godel-translation","aliases":["89-thm-godel-translation"],"display":"thm-godel-translation — Godel Translation Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic]]","[[89-df-godel-translation]]","[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-godel-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-godel-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-translation — Godel Translation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f12af111ab11110d\" href=\"?note=f12af111ab11110d\" title=\"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic\">89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c0998e9f7d64222\" href=\"?note=4c0998e9f7d64222\" title=\"89-df-godel-translation\">89-df-godel-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{IPC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> is the intuitionistic\npropositional theorem set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the Gödel\ntranslation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c0998e9f7d64222\" href=\"?note=4c0998e9f7d64222\" title=\"89-df-godel-translation\">89-df-godel-translation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{IPC}\\Longleftrightarrow g(A)\\in\\mathrm{S4}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{IPC}\\Longleftrightarrow g(A)\\in\\mathrm{S4}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(A)\">\\(g(A)\\)</span> : Gödel 翻译；不仅原子被盒化，蕴含也被盒化</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPC}\">\\(\\mathrm{IPC}\\)</span> : 直觉主义命题逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\)</span> : S4模态逻辑</li>\n<li>Gödel翻译嵌入直觉主义逻辑到S4</li>\n<li>翻译函数与 IPC theorem-set 现由独立定义原子提供；本原子只承担\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{IPC}\\Longleftrightarrow g(A)\\in\\mathrm{S4}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{IPC}\\Longleftrightarrow g(A)\\in\\mathrm{S4}\\)</span> 这一实质定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic","status":"resolved","id":"f12af111ab11110d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic]